  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Health in Bangladesh &#x2013; International Climate Finance through UN Organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a specific component for International Climate Finance (ICF) under the technical assistance through UN organisation. The objective of this component is to improve knowledge and skills among health policymakers, managers, practitioners and targeted beneficiaries on climate change and health. The component also works to build climate resilience health systems.</narrative>
  </description>
